[gd_scene format=3]
; Polygon2D rotation on a normal-mapped polygon: Upright and Turned carry the same CanvasTexture,
; whose flat normal map tilts to +x, and Turned is rotated a quarter turn. The item's basis turns the
; normal (canvas.glsl:708), so Turned is lit from below. No other scene rotates a normal-mapped item.

